RecompOne change for MediEvilRecomp ITA: texture picker for shader materials.
With ShaderMaterials.PickEnabled, the G-buffer gets a third target with the texture of every pixel
(tpage, clut, u, v) and ShaderMaterials.Picked holds the one under the point chosen with a left click
on the game image (ShaderMaterials.PickX/PickY, default the centre).
Author: https://github.com/Leproide
License of this change: GPL-3.0-or-later (RecompOne code itself keeps its own license).
Apply after effect-lights.patch:  git -C RecompOne apply ../recompone-fixes/material-picker.patch

diff --git a/RecompOne.Runtime/Gpu/Backends/Common/GlCore.cs b/RecompOne.Runtime/Gpu/Backends/Common/GlCore.cs
